  <wpt lat="35.107386" lon="-120.624050"><name>Old Juan’s Cantina (mi 0.0)</name><cmt>Food at mile 0.0, 0.03 mi off route. Mapped in OpenStreetMap; not verified on the ground.</cmt><desc>Food</desc><sym>Restaurant</sym><type>Food</type></wpt><wpt lat="35.109481" lon="-120.626897"><name>Toilets (mi 0.0)</name><cmt>Toilets at mile 0.0, 0.25 mi off route. Mapped in OpenStreetMap; not verified on the ground.</cmt><desc>Toilets</desc><sym>Restroom</sym><type>Toilets</type></wpt><wpt lat="35.106793" lon="-120.623546"><name>Johnson’s Market &amp; Gifts (mi 0.0)</name><cmt>Store at mile 0.0, 0.02 mi off route. Mapped in OpenStreetMap; not verified on the ground.</cmt><desc>Store</desc><sym>Convenience Store</sym><type>Store</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.996229" lon="-120.436301"><name>Rancho Nipomo (mi 16.1)</name><cmt>Food at mile 16.1, 0.05 mi off route. Mapped in OpenStreetMap; not verified on the ground.</cmt><desc>Food</desc><sym>Restaurant</sym><type>Food</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.985294" lon="-120.437662"><name>Toilets (mi 16.9)</name><cmt>Toilets at mile 16.9, 0.21 mi off route. Mapped in OpenStreetMap; not verified on the ground.</cmt><desc>Toilets</desc><sym>Restroom</sym><type>Toilets</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.852801" lon="-120.255892"><name>Winery Riverbench (mi 33.5)</name><cmt>Winery at mile 33.5, 0.08 mi off route. Mapped in OpenStreetMap; not verified on the ground.</cmt><desc>Winery</desc><sym>Bar</sym><type>Winery</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.824351" lon="-120.232009"><name>Foxen Winery (mi 36.2)</name><cmt>Winery at mile 36.2, 0.02 mi off route. Foxen Canyon Road, right on the route. OpenStreetMap carries two Foxen tasting rooms 0.35 mi apart and names them only #1 and #2; this is the northern one. Added by hand.</cmt><desc>Winery</desc><sym>Bar</sym><type>Winery</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.664961" lon="-120.115353"><name>Los Olivos Wine Merchant &amp; Cafe (mi 52.9)</name><cmt>Food at mile 52.9, 0.04 mi off route. Los Olivos, on Grand Avenue. Added by hand.</cmt><desc>Food</desc><sym>Restaurant</sym><type>Food</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.650604" lon="-120.095171"><name>Bridlewood Winery (mi 53.7)</name><cmt>Winery at mile 53.7, 1.14 mi off route. 3555 Roblar Ave, Santa Ynez. Chosen by hand. The pin is Roblar Avenue itself, not the driveway - OpenStreetMap has no address point for 3555 - so navigate by name rather than by the dot. Added by hand.</cmt><desc>Winery</desc><sym>Bar</sym><type>Winery</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.606246" lon="-120.101650"><name>El Rancho Market (mi 56.9)</name><cmt>Store at mile 56.9, 1.19 mi off route. 2886 Mission Dr, Solvang. Full grocery with a deli counter - the last proper resupply before Solvang. Sits 1.2 mi off the line. Added by hand.</cmt><desc>Store</desc><sym>Shopping Center</sym><type>Store</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.607541" lon="-120.123187"><name>Sunny Fields Park (mi 57.0)</name><cmt>Park at mile 57.0, 0.03 mi off route. Mapped in OpenStreetMap; not verified on the ground.</cmt><desc>Park</desc><sym>Park</sym><type>Park</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.608023" lon="-120.122861"><name>Toilets (mi 57.0)</name><cmt>Toilets at mile 57.0, 0.03 mi off route. Mapped in OpenStreetMap; not verified on the ground.</cmt><desc>Toilets</desc><sym>Restroom</sym><type>Toilets</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.594789" lon="-120.138058"><name>Birkholm's Solvang Danish Bakery (mi 58.1)</name><cmt>Food at mile 58.1, 0.24 mi off route. Mapped in OpenStreetMap; not verified on the ground.</cmt><desc>Food</desc><sym>Restaurant</sym><type>Food</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.594315" lon="-120.136626"><name>Old Mission Santa Ines (mi 58.1)</name><cmt>Historic at mile 58.1, 0.19 mi off route. Solvang, where the day ends. Founded 1804; church and museum open to visitors. Added by hand.</cmt><desc>Historic</desc><sym>Museum</sym><type>Historic</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.595877" lon="-120.140213"><name>Water (mi 58.8)</name><cmt>Water at mile 58.8, 0.22 mi off route. Mapped in OpenStreetMap; not verified on the ground.</cmt><desc>Water</desc><sym>Drinking Water</sym><type>Water</type></wpt><wpt lat="34.59566865116358" lon="-120.14642243273556"><name>FINISH — Solvang</name><sym>Flag, Green</sym><type>Finish</type></wpt><trk>
